      "detail": [],
      "banding": "top-pick percentile: >=80 GOOD, >=60 WEAK, >=40 MEDIOCRE, <40 POOR. 50 is what random selection within that mutation count would achieve.",
      "consequence": "the optimisation machinery (QUBO construction, Ising mapping, exact and QAOA solvers) is verified correct independently of this; what is measured here is whether the QUBO faithfully represents the ML landscape, which is a separate question. Because fidelity degrades at 3+ mutations, final candidate ranking is taken from direct ML re-scoring rather than from QUBO energy.",
